      "c2pa:promptSummary": "Author specified concept and provided source framework URLs (C2PA spec, provenancedisclosure.com). Directed approximately twelve revision rounds covering: model identification granularity, rubric attribution, progressive prompting assessment, prompt quality as contribution dimension, machine-readable output control, tiered human attribution, document stage, terminology reframing (disclosure \u2192 creation record), multi-party authorship with CRediT and DX extension roles, modality-specific guidance for code/images/audio/video, and prototype framing.",
